  "title": "Don't include config.h in the example plugin.",
  "description": "Wireshark's config.h isn't available to third-party plugins, and the\ndevelopers of the plugin might not even have their own config.h, so\ndon't include it in the example (if it *does* have its own config.h, the\ndevelopers will presumbly know that they should include it).\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 6d96d8bbc203b6481cfa86967e1f2671a49fa1be)",
